{"title":"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Handy Aaron helped a neighbor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcdf445651d486149cfa3bbc5b8784f772cb91f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> hours on Monday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes on Tuesday, from 8:20 to 10:45 on Wednesday morning, and a half-hour on Friday. He is paid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/6/31694dffa8d324144c77132698907df5400f1655.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> per hour. How much did he earn for the week?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/f/02facc62dba68191a1493a3ae544d3aa68132cc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\textdollar 8 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\textdollar 9 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\textdollar 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\textdollar 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\textdollar 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's convert everything to minutes and add them together. On Monday he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/b/c6b726e78e4d85e85be9546b248e763a5d50496f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac54 \\cdot 60 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" /> minutes. On Tuesday he worked <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. On Wednesday he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b837e40bcba89b07dc15947c659b84e84fef8ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(60)+25=145$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" /> minutes. On Friday he worked <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/b/0dbf8489b5bbc3057f353d0351199949837e3518.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{2}=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" /> minutes. This adds up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d753911702630f779cc30234c87c2df800dae56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75+50+145+30=300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"199\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1ee228e1d4144930c7eaf82aa23d820328ac060.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300/60=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5ca8b45f394f96e0f9b812e1dc011c9b8c7fab40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\textdollar 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"127\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 8\">2004 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2004\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Proble